# Press video cuts live in the shared Drive folder, not in git. The 4x5 is
# 77MB and the 16x9 is 18.5MB; committing them would take this repo from
# roughly 5MB to over 100MB permanently, and git keeps every version.
press-assets/*.mp4

# Oi BTS 3 and 4 are held out of the public kit by ruling, 12 Aug 2026.
# Oi_Press_3 has client footage legible on the monitors; Oi_Press_4 is a
# cast-and-crew wrap shot including people who read as talent rather than
# crew. Talent releases usually cover the client's campaign, not Oi's own
# PR in perpetuity, and that needs checking before either is published.
# The files stay where they were put; they simply do not enter git.
press-assets/Oi_Press_3.jpg
